<%= @reset ? "Your password was reset" : "Welcome to the SASH portal" %>

Hello <%= @user.name %>, <%= @reset ? "an administrator set a new password for your account." : "an administrator created an account for you." %>

Sign-in page:       <%= @login_url %>
Email:              <%= @user.email %>
Temporary password: <%= @password %>
Role:               <%= @user.role == "admin" ? "Admin" : "Warehouse Manager" %>

You will be asked to choose your own password the first time you sign in.
If you did not expect this email, contact your administrator.
